# OpenAI API Compatibility Guidelines

## 🎯 API Endpoint Requirements

### Core Endpoints Implementation
- **`/v1/chat/completions`** - Primary chat endpoint with streaming support
- **`/v1/models`** - Model listing with proper OpenAI format
- **`/v1/embeddings`** - Text embeddings (post-MVP)
- **`/v1/completions`** - Legacy completions (post-MVP)

### Request/Response Format Compliance

#### Chat Completions Request
```go
type ChatCompletionRequest struct {
    Model            string                 `json:"model" binding:"required"`
    Messages         []ChatMessage         `json:"messages" binding:"required"`
    MaxTokens        *int                  `json:"max_tokens,omitempty"`
    Temperature      *float64              `json:"temperature,omitempty"`
    TopP             *float64              `json:"top_p,omitempty"`
    N                *int                  `json:"n,omitempty"`
    Stream           *bool                 `json:"stream,omitempty"`
    Stop             interface{}           `json:"stop,omitempty"` // string or []string
    PresencePenalty  *float64              `json:"presence_penalty,omitempty"`
    FrequencyPenalty *float64              `json:"frequency_penalty,omitempty"`
    LogitBias        map[string]float64    `json:"logit_bias,omitempty"`
    User             *string               `json:"user,omitempty"`
}
```

#### Chat Completions Response
```go
type ChatCompletionResponse struct {
    ID      string                   `json:"id"`
    Object  string                   `json:"object"`
    Created int64                    `json:"created"`
    Model   string                   `json:"model"`
    Choices []ChatCompletionChoice   `json:"choices"`
    Usage   ChatCompletionUsage      `json:"usage"`
}

type ChatCompletionChoice struct {
    Index        int                `json:"index"`
    Message      ChatMessage        `json:"message,omitempty"`
    Delta        *ChatMessage       `json:"delta,omitempty"` // For streaming
    FinishReason *string            `json:"finish_reason"`
}
```

#### Model Listing Response
```go
type ModelsResponse struct {
    Object string  `json:"object"`
    Data   []Model `json:"data"`
}

type Model struct {
    ID         string      `json:"id"`
    Object     string      `json:"object"`
    OwnedBy    string      `json:"owned_by"`
    Permission []ModelPerm `json:"permission"`
}
```

### Error Format Compatibility
```go
type OpenAIError struct {
    Error struct {
        Message string      `json:"message"`
        Type    string      `json:"type"`
        Param   interface{} `json:"param,omitempty"`
        Code    interface{} `json:"code,omitempty"`
    } `json:"error"`
}

// Common error types to match OpenAI
const (
    ErrorTypeInvalidRequest     = "invalid_request_error"
    ErrorTypeAuthentication     = "authentication_error"
    ErrorTypePermission        = "permission_error"
    ErrorTypeNotFound          = "not_found_error"
    ErrorTypeRateLimit         = "rate_limit_exceeded"
    ErrorTypeQuotaExceeded     = "quota_exceeded"
    ErrorTypeServerError       = "server_error"
    ErrorTypeEngineOverloaded  = "engine_overloaded"
)
```

## 🔄 Request/Response Conversion

### OpenAI → Ollama Conversion
```go
func ConvertChatRequest(openaiReq ChatCompletionRequest) OllamaChatRequest {
    return OllamaChatRequest{
        Model:  mapModelName(openaiReq.Model),
        Messages: convertMessages(openaiReq.Messages),
        Stream: openaiReq.Stream != nil && *openaiReq.Stream,
        Options: OllamaOptions{
            Temperature: openaiReq.Temperature,
            TopP:       openaiReq.TopP,
            Stop:       convertStop(openaiReq.Stop),
        },
    }
}
```

### Ollama → OpenAI Response Conversion
```go
func ConvertChatResponse(ollamaResp OllamaChatResponse, model string) ChatCompletionResponse {
    return ChatCompletionResponse{
        ID:      generateChatID(),
        Object:  "chat.completion",
        Created: time.Now().Unix(),
        Model:   model,
        Choices: []ChatCompletionChoice{
            {
                Index: 0,
                Message: ChatMessage{
                    Role:    "assistant",
                    Content: ollamaResp.Message.Content,
                },
                FinishReason: convertFinishReason(ollamaResp.Done),
            },
        },
        Usage: calculateUsage(ollamaResp),
    }
}
```

## 📡 Streaming Implementation

### Server-Sent Events (SSE) Format
```go
func (h *ChatHandler) streamResponse(w http.ResponseWriter, req ChatCompletionRequest) {
    w.Header().Set("Content-Type", "text/event-stream")
    w.Header().Set("Cache-Control", "no-cache")
    w.Header().Set("Connection", "keep-alive")
    
    flusher, ok := w.(http.Flusher)
    if !ok {
        http.Error(w, "Streaming unsupported", http.StatusInternalServerError)
        return
    }
    
    for chunk := range streamChannel {
        data := ChatCompletionResponse{
            ID:      req.ID,
            Object:  "chat.completion.chunk",
            Created: time.Now().Unix(),
            Model:   req.Model,
            Choices: []ChatCompletionChoice{
                {
                    Index: 0,
                    Delta: &ChatMessage{Content: chunk.Content},
                },
            },
        }
        
        fmt.Fprintf(w, "data: %s\n\n", toJSON(data))
        flusher.Flush()
    }
    
    fmt.Fprintf(w, "data: [DONE]\n\n")
}
```

## 🔑 Authentication Header Handling
```go
// Support both Authorization and X-API-Key headers
func extractAPIKey(r *http.Request) string {
    // Check Authorization: Bearer <token>
    auth := r.Header.Get("Authorization")
    if strings.HasPrefix(auth, "Bearer ") {
        return strings.TrimPrefix(auth, "Bearer ")
    }
    
    // Check X-API-Key header  
    return r.Header.Get("X-API-Key")
}
```

## 📊 Usage Tracking (OpenAI Compatible)
```go
type ChatCompletionUsage struct {
    PromptTokens     int `json:"prompt_tokens"`
    CompletionTokens int `json:"completion_tokens"`
    TotalTokens      int `json:"total_tokens"`
}

// Estimate tokens for compatibility (Ollama doesn't provide exact counts)
func estimateTokenCount(text string) int {
    // Rough estimation: ~4 characters per token for English
    return len(text) / 4
}
```